{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SimulatedPaywallService"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this as the ","type":"text"},{"code":"service:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" while the paywall vendor decision is still open.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It behaves like a micro version of the real thing: entitlement changes are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pushed through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/SimulatedPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" so they flow through the real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pipeline and survive later refresh\/restore — exactly as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"RevenueCat\/StoreKit service would.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The simulation surface ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"grantPro()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setRestoreShouldFail(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", …) is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; the dev paywall UI in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxDevPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drives it. Hold a single instance and pass it to both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store.configured()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".devPaywall(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" view."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only models ","type":"text"},{"code":"isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“trial” yields ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro == true"},{"text":" and is distinguished only in the log line.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This service simulates purchases — nothing is charged and no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receipt exists. Release builds are supported so TestFlight\/QA can drive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the paywall vendor-free, but the service logs a fault at init in Release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a submission tripwire: replace it with a real "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" before"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"shipping to the App Store."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Warning","style":"warning"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/simulatedpaywallservice"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/SimulatedPaywallService","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SimulatedPaywallService"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SimulatedPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"title":"SimulatedPaywallService","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09SimulatedB7ServiceC"},"abstract":[{"text":"A stateful, fully driveable ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sw